In Data sstructures and Algorithms functions are used to perform operations on data.
Think of each operation in Data structure as a function.

e.g
Arrays -> search() , update()
stack -> push() , pop()
Queue -> enqueue() , dequeue()
Linked List -> insert() , delete() , traverse()
Tree -> insertNode() , searchNode() , inorder()
Graph -> addEdge() , bfs() , dfs()
Algorithm -> binarySearch() , mergesort() , dijkstra()
